        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Game of the Goose, Medina\n- Topics: Board games, player counts, gameplay, setting\n\nFacts:\n- The Game of the Goose, also called Goose game, is a board game in which two or more players move pieces around a track by rolling a die.\n- Medina is a board game set in 1822 in a desert city near the Atlas Mountains.\n- In Medina, three or four players compete to be the most influential developer of Medina.\n- Variations of Medina allow two or five players.",
